-# This person's finished works that are missing something a job failed to make.
-#
-# No action button, deliberately: a depositor cannot re-run an enrichment job, so
-# the honest affordance is the record itself plus what is missing from it. The
-# panel exists so a missing thumbnail reads as a fault somebody can fix rather
-# than as how DRS looks.
-#
-# Rendered only when there are rows, like the panel above it, and placed after it
-# because that one has something the reader can do.
.my-drs-card.bg-white.border.rounded-3.overflow-hidden.shadow-sm.mb-4
  .my-drs-card__head.p-3
    %h5.mb-1
      %i.fa-solid.fa-triangle-exclamation.text-warning.me-2{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
      Works with something missing
    %p.small.text-muted.mb-0
      These are published and readable. DRS staff can rebuild what is missing — contact them if it matters to you.
  .table-responsive
    %table.table.table-borderless.admin-registry-table
      %thead
        %tr
          %th{ scope: 'col' } Work
          %th{ scope: 'col' } What is missing
      %tbody
        - incomplete.each do |work|
          %tr
            %td.admin-registry-table__name
              %i.fa-regular.fa-file.text-muted.me-2{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
              = link_to Array(work['title_tsim']).first.presence || '(untitled)', work_path(work)
            %td.text-muted.small= IncompleteReasons.describe(work.incomplete_reason)
